  "translation": "Na Hazael i tok: Bilong wanem, bikman bilong mi, yu kraunat? Na em i tok: Long wanem mi save ⟨את⟩ olgeta samting yu bai mekim long ol pikinini bilong Yisrael — ol samting nogut: yu bai salim paia long ol banis bilong ol, na yu bai kilim ol yangpela man bilong ol wantaim bainat, na yu bai brukim olgeta ol liklik pikinini bilong ol, na yu bai brukim opim bel bilong ol meri gat pikinini.",
